      "content": "---\ntitle: \"Artificer Discipline\"\nslug: \"artificer-discipline\"\ntype: talent\nclassName: \"Artificer\"\nclassSlug: \"artificer\"\nclassCategory: \"Magical Classes\"\ntalentTier: \"Tier 1\"\ntier: \"Tier 1\"\nranks: 5\nprerequisite: \"None\"\ncost: \"3 TP to unlock; rank costs scale by progression rules\"\ncooldown: \"Passive\"\nscaling: \"Crafting-related D100 skill checks improve as the discipline ranks up.\"\nsynergy: \"Foundation talent for crafting, smithing, alchemy, enchanting, runecrafting, salvaging, construct creation, reverse engineering, and item analysis.\"\ntags:\n  - \"talent\"\n  - \"artificer\"\n  - \"tier-1\"\nvisibility: public\nsourceOrder: 1\n---\n\n# Artificer Discipline\n\n## Overview\nCrafting-related D100 skill checks improve as the discipline ranks up.\n\n## Rank 1\nGain +5 to all crafting-related D100 skill checks.\n\n## Rank 2\nIncrease the discipline bonus and broaden reliable crafting applications.\n\n## Rank 3\nImprove complex crafting, salvaging, and analysis checks.\n\n## Rank 4\nStrengthen advanced creation workflows and specialist crafting checks.\n\n## Rank 5\nMaster the discipline of creation across Artificer systems.\n\n## Prerequisites\nNone\n\n## Scaling\nCrafting-related D100 skill checks improve as the discipline ranks up.\n\n## Synergy\nFoundation talent for crafting, smithing, alchemy, enchanting, runecrafting, salvaging, construct creation, reverse engineering, and item analysis.\n\n## GM Notes\nInformation coming soon\n"
